# What the web build does not need.
#
# The deploy uploads the whole workspace, because `apps/web` depends on
# `packages/pet` and pnpm resolves that from the root. Without this file the
# upload also walks the Tauri build directory — three gigabytes of Rust
# artifacts — and the deploy stalls before it starts.
#
# Every package.json stays, so `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` still sees the
# same workspace the lockfile was written against.

node_modules
.git

# Build output, rebuilt on Vercel.
**/target
**/dist
**/.svelte-kit
**/.vercel

# Not part of the web app.
apps/desktop/src
apps/desktop/src-tauri
apps/desktop/index.html
contracts
docs
.github
